OL,3,AMushroom murderer fails to overturn
OL,4,Aconvictions in Australian court
OL,5,Achallenge
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Victoria's Court of Appeal on
OL,8,FFriday, three judges threw out her
OL,9,Fappeal against her convictions and
OL,10,Fagreed with the prosecution that her
OL,11,Fsentence was inadequate, as it allowed
OL,12,Ffor the possibility of freedom.
OL,14,FPatterson's crimes were
OL,15,F"extraordinarily cold and calculated"
OL,16,Fand had to be "denounced in the
OL,17,Fstrongest terms," they said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
